sections.body:
| What | Minimum ratio (WCAG AA) |
|---|---|
| normal text. | 4.5:1. |
| large text (≥ 24px, or ≥ 18.66px bold). | 3:1. |
| UI components and graphics (borders, icons). | 3:1 against adjacent colours. |
| focus indicator. | 3:1 against what's next to it. |

```css
:root {
  --color-error: #b91c1c;          /* 6.5:1 on white, 5.9:1 on #f3f4f6 */
  --color-focus: #1d4ed8;
}
.btn-primary:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--color-focus);
  outline-offset: 3px;             /* gap so the ring sits on the page, not the button */
}
```

